WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:04.490
A counterparty mark-up of a mutual non-disclosure agreement.

2
00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:11.250
The AI review checks Legal's playbook, clause by clause: thirteen clauses for an NDA.

3
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.970
Watch it work.

4
00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:17.370
Findings land one at a time, with the rule and proposed wording.

5
00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:21.450
Eight of thirteen pass, with exactly five deviations.

6
00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:26.650
Failing clauses block approval, unless a lawyer overrides them with a reason.

7
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.050
Proposed wording sits with the rule.
